# jackd2 from the OpenMixer channel: Debian's jackd2 with the jack2 metadata
# fix (jackaudio/jack2#988, Open-Mixer/zynthian-sys#24). A JACK client that
# dies without closing strands its Berkeley DB mutexes until no client can
# open the metadata store (BDB2034), and a jackd restart does not clear it.
# Installed by scripts/recipes/install_openmixer.sh. This file and the
# channel's jackd2 (Open-Mixer/.github packaging/jackd2) go away together,
# once upstream jack2 and Debian carry the fix.
Package: jackd2 libjack-jackd2-0 libjack-jackd2-dev jackd2-firewire
Pin: release o=OpenMixer
Pin-Priority: 990
